	)
	(text "   (b) 原图 Q730 标 2=D / 3=S, 与 SOT-23 的 1=G,2=S,3=D 不一致; 本页按 2N7002 实际封装脚序画,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 140.322 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "36d41348-c130-4fa6-aa99-dd5d38dc5bdb")
	)
	(text "   (b) 过温: RV730 是 NTC, 与光敏管并联在 A 点与栅极节点之间; 温度升 -> 阻值降 -> 栅极电压升高。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 123.812 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "41e54586-238b-4739-a44b-e517213c125b")
	)
	(text "3. 原图没给、需要核实的几处"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 133.718 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "61d21e75-34e4-4b3f-bb22-2957b169ca95")
	)
	(text "       压降超过 LED 正向压降后 OC730 的 LED(1-2) 起辉, 光敏管(4-3) 导通, 把栅极节点拉向 A 点。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 120.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "721ca0b5-83ff-4c53-92cc-87f7a8023938")
	)
	(text "   (c) 关断: 栅极超过 Q730 的 Vth -> Q730 导通 -> SNSBOOST 短接到 PGND -> 升压关断。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 127.114 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8c0e9f0e-0226-451f-892b-2ef25f39dee3")
	)
	(text "   R736 既是 A 点的限流电阻, 也与 RV730 / R735 组成栅极分压; R735 是栅极下拉, 无故障时保证 Q730 关断。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 130.416 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8ed43c55-1570-4eec-87a5-1f1aa97aef61")
	)
	(text "   (a) 过压: SVCC-R733-[C]-R734-[D]-D730(齐纳)-AGND。R734 上的压降 = I x R734;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 117.208 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "95060a4f-f593-459d-ac86-b8ffef77b2d7")
	)
	(text "1. 这块电路是干什么的"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bdfe8bbe-8870-4475-824a-24fe9e630814")
	)
	(text "二次侧 · SVCC / AGND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 29.972 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c5ba1c32-4e7f-403d-bc8a-4e0db901a507")
	)
	(text "       打板前按所选封装核对一遍脚序。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 143.624 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ee16a7bd-ff7e-4d22-8059-0a34677bf829")
	)
	(text "   两个故障源分别经 OC730 光耦 / RV730 热敏电阻作用到 Q730 的栅极; 两侧只经光耦相联, PGND 与 AGND 分开。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 110.604 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f0774736-9fb7-47c5-b66d-e8d02e18c331")
	)
